<Editorial title="A conversation — Danny McGiffin" description="Bring the part of your business held together by memory, effort, or heroics. Let’s talk about what could work better.">
<main id="main-content" class="section subpage">
<p class="eyebrow">The work begins with a conversation</p>
<h1>Show me what’s<br/>
<em>being held together.</em>
</h1>
<div class="reading" style="margin-left:0">
<p>The handoff everyone chases. The spreadsheet only one person understands. The experience you want to deliver, but can’t quite repeat.</p>
<p>You don’t need a brief or a polished diagnosis. Tell me what happens, who it affects, and what you wish were different. We’ll start there.</p>
<a class="show-me" style="display:inline-block" href={bookingUrl('machinery-conversation')}>Let’s talk. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
<p style="margin-top:28px;font-size:12px">A 30-minute conversation with Danny.</p>
</div>
</main>
</Editorial>
